      "description": "Square pause icon and caption; the live component derives play/pause state from the video. This snippet previews the pause affordance.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-inverse\"><button class=\"ds-playback\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Mettre la vidéo en pause\"><span class=\"ds-playback-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M8 3v18M16 3v18\"/></svg></span><span>Pause</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-inverse{background:var(--site-color-inverseSurface,#101314);color:var(--site-color-inverseText,#F6F7F6);padding:24px;}.ds-playback{display:grid;justify-items:center;align-content:end;gap:8px;min-width:51px;min-height:79px;max-width:10ch;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--site-caption-fontFamily,\"site_hanken_grotesk\",sans-serif);font-size:var(--site-caption-fontSize,clamp(0.875rem, 0.875rem + 0vw, 0.875rem));font-weight:var(--site-caption-fontWeight,400);line-height:var(--site-caption-lineHeight,1.5);letter-spacing:var(--site-caption-letterSpacing,0em);cursor:pointer;}.ds-playback-icon{width:50px;height:50px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:2px solid currentColor;}.ds-playback:hover{background:transparent;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;}.ds-playback:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:6px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Public destinations and languages",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Six destinations with the current-page underline and language choices. The mobile control is previewed separately.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-navigation\"><nav aria-label=\"Navigation principale\"><ul class=\"ds-links\"><li><a href=\"#news\">Actualités</a></li><li><a href=\"#artworks\" aria-current=\"page\">Œuvres</a></li><li><a href=\"#exhibitions\">Expositions</a></li><li><a href=\"#publications\">Publications</a></li><li><a href=\"#expertise\">Demande d’expertise</a></li><li><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></li></ul></nav><nav aria-label=\"Langue\"><ul class=\"ds-languages\"><li><a href=\"#fr\" aria-current=\"true\" lang=\"fr\">FR</a></li><li><a href=\"#en\" lang=\"en\">EN</a></li></ul></nav></div>",
      "css": ".ds-navigation{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;background:var(--site-color-inverseSurface,#101314);color:var(--site-color-inverseText,#F6F7F6);padding:20px 24px;font-family:var(--site-navigation-fontFamily,\"site_hanken_grotesk\",sans-serif);}.ds-links,.ds-languages{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;}.ds-links{justify-content:flex-end;gap:4px 20px;}.ds-links li{min-width:0;max-width:18ch;}.ds-navigation a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-links a{font-family:var(--site-navigation-fontFamily,\"site_hanken_grotesk\",sans-serif);font-size:var(--site-navigation-fontSize,clamp(0.875rem, 0.8309859154929577rem + 0.18779342723004694vw, 1rem));font-weight:var(--site-navigation-fontWeight,500);line-height:var(--site-navigation-lineHeight,1.5);letter-spacing:var(--site-navigation-letterSpacing,0em);}.ds-links a[aria-current=\"page\"]{text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:2px;font-weight:600;}.ds-languages{gap:4px 14px;}.ds-languages li+li::before{content:\"/\";margin-right:6px;}.ds-languages a{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:400;}.ds-languages a[aria-current=\"true\"]{font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;}.ds-navigation a:hover{color:inherit;}.ds-navigation a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Artwork card with media fallback",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "artwork-card",
      "description": "Open generic square artwork tile. The PLP context crops actual images with cover in both generic/client profiles; this snippet shows the existing unavailable-image fallback.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-artwork\"><a href=\"#artwork\"><div class=\"ds-artwork-image\"><div class=\"ds-artwork-placeholder\"><span>Image indisponible</span></div></div><h2>Œuvre de démonstration</h2><p>Artiste non renseigné</p></a></article>",
      "css": ".ds-artwork{min-width:0;color:var(--site-color-text,#101314);font-family:var(--site-body-fontFamily,\"site_hanken_grotesk\",sans-serif);}.ds-artwork a{display:block;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}.ds-artwork-image{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1;overflow:hidden;background:var(--site-color-mutedSurface,#E7EAE8);display:grid;place-items:center;}.ds-artwork-placeholder{display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:220px;aspect-ratio:4/3;width:100%;background:var(--site-color-mutedSurface,#E7EAE8);color:var(--site-color-mutedText,#48544F);font-family:var(--site-body-fontFamily,\"site_hanken_grotesk\",sans-serif);font-size:var(--site-body-fontSize,clamp(1rem, 0.9559859154929577rem + 0.18779342723004694vw, 1.125rem));font-weight:var(--site-body-fontWeight,400);line-height:var(--site-body-lineHeight,1.5);letter-spacing:var(--site-body-letterSpacing,0em);}.ds-artwork h2{font-family:var(--site-h3-fontFamily,\"site_hanken_grotesk\",sans-serif);font-size:var(--site-h3-fontSize,clamp(1.25rem, 1.073943661971831rem + 0.7511737089201878vw, 1.75rem));font-weight:var(--site-h3-fontWeight,400);line-height:var(--site-h3-lineHeight,1.2);letter-spacing:var(--site-h3-letterSpacing,0em);margin:18px 0 6px;max-width:28ch;text-wrap:balance;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-artwork p{margin:0;color:var(--site-color-mutedText,#48544F);font-family:var(--site-body-fontFamily,\"site_hanken_grotesk\",sans-serif);font-size:var(--site-body-fontSize,clamp(1rem, 0.9559859154929577rem + 0.18779342723004694vw, 1.125rem));font-weight:var(--site-body-fontWeight,400);line-height:var(--site-body-lineHeight,1.5);letter-spacing:var(--site-body-letterSpacing,0em);}.ds-artwork a:hover h2{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;}.ds-artwork a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--site-color-focus,#21623F);outline-offset:4px;} .ds-artwork-image img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Demo-gallery portrait artwork card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "artwork-card",
      "description": "Registered client card with4:5 media and caption divider. The PLP crops images with cover; this standalone snippet displays its unavailable-image state.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-client-card\"><a href=\"#artwork\"><div class=\"ds-client-image\">Image indisponible</div><div class=\"ds-client-caption\"><h2>Œuvre de démonstration</h2><p>Artiste non renseigné</p><small>Année · Technique de démonstration</small></div></a></article>",
      "css": ".ds-client-card{--site-h3-fontFamily:\"site_source_serif_4\",serif;--site-color-background:#F3F0E8;min-width:0;background:var(--site-color-background);color:var(--site-color-text,#101314);font-family:var(--site-body-fontFamily,\"site_hanken_grotesk\",sans-serif);}.ds-client-card a{display:block;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}.ds-client-image{aspect-ratio:4/5;background:var(--site-color-mutedSurface,#E7EAE8);color:var(--site-color-mutedText,#48544F);display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;}.ds-client-caption{padding-block:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--site-color-border,#64736A);}.ds-client-caption h2{font-family:var(--site-h3-fontFamily);font-size:var(--site-h3-fontSize,1.75rem);font-weight:400;line-height:var(--site-h3-lineHeight,1.2);margin:0 0 8px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-client-caption p{margin:0;font-size:var(--site-body-fontSize,1.125rem);line-height:var(--site-body-lineHeight,1.5);}.ds-client-caption small{font-family:var(--site-caption-fontFamily,\"site_hanken_grotesk\",sans-serif);font-size:var(--site-caption-fontSize,.875rem);line-height:var(--site-caption-lineHeight,1.5);color:var(--site-color-mutedText,#48544F);}.ds-client-card a:hover h2{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.2em;}.ds-client-card a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--site-color-focus,#21623F);outline-offset:5px;} .ds-client-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Outlined search field",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Existing MUI outlined field used by catalogue search and contact. Square, white surface, muted label and semantic border/focus/error roles from create-site-theme.ts.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span>Rechercher une œuvre</span><input type=\"search\" name=\"q\" placeholder=\"Titre ou artiste\" maxlength=\"320\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:grid;gap:8px;color:var(--site-color-mutedText,#48544F);font-family:var(--site-body-fontFamily,\"site_hanken_grotesk\",sans-serif);font-size:var(--site-body-fontSize,1rem);line-height:var(--site-body-lineHeight,1.5);}.ds-field input{min-width:0;min-height:44px;padding:16.5px 14px;border:1px solid var(--site-color-border,#64736A);border-radius:0;background:var(--site-color-surface,#FFFFFF);color:var(--site-color-text,#101314);font:inherit;caret-color:var(--site-color-accent,#3C554A);}.ds-field input:hover{border-color:var(--site-color-linkHover,#183C2B);}.ds-field:focus-within{color:var(--site-color-text,#101314);}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--site-color-focus,#21623F);outline-offset:-2px;border-color:var(--site-color-focus,#21623F);}.ds-field input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--site-color-error,#9F2424);}.ds-field input:disabled{color:var(--site-color-disabledText,#66716C);cursor:not-allowed;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Projection — le film avant tout",
    "overview": "Projection gives the artwork room to hold attention. Dark, immersive media and a compact invitation establish the opening; pale editorial surfaces, measured typography, and generous gaps carry the visitor into the collection. Navigation and controls stay visible without becoming the subject.\n\nThe public gallery uses a flat, square, restrained vocabulary. Imagery supplies texture and color; interface depth comes from contrast and protected reading zones. The default identity is a configurable starting point for each gallery: typography and color roles stay coherent when their assigned values change.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Immersive media with a compact invitation and visible playback controls.",
      "A restrained sans-serif hierarchy and underlined text actions.",
      "Open artwork layouts, square geometry, and generous spacing.",
      "Pale editorial surfaces following the dark first viewport.",
      "Theme roles shared by CSS and MUI, with explicit mobile and media fallbacks."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Role Pair Rule",
        "body": "Use the foreground and background roles together; a client palette change must preserve the contrast pairs declared in `page-composer/definitions.ts`.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Protected Media Rule",
        "body": "Keep the inverse text roles and the implemented dark reading supports together whenever text or controls overlay media. A legible poster alone does not establish legibility for a replacement film.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Shared Role Rule",
        "body": "Extend the existing typography roles through the theme adapter; preserve each component's hierarchy and responsive measure when a gallery chooses a different family.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Preserve the existing flat cards and square actions; use spacing, contrast, and the implemented dividers to express hierarchy.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use the configured color and typography roles in both CSS and MUI.",
      "**Do** keep readable inverse text supports and visible playback controls over media.",
      "**Do** preserve square, flat controls and open artwork layouts.",
      "**Do** fill catalogue image frames with cover cropping, following the user’s 29 October decision; preserve an explicit whole-image examination path in the artwork detail.",
      "**Do** keep keyboard focus, the mobile menu, language choices, and fallback content usable.",
      "**Do** identify synthetic demonstration material until gallery-owned content replaces it."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** introduce rounded card shells or raised button shadows into the default Projection world.",
      "**Don't** hard-code the default font or palette into new public components outside the role system.",
      "**Don't** treat Source Serif 4 as the active default pairing or prescribe the demo sculpture's colors as interface tokens.",
      "**Don't** use playback or animation as a prerequisite for reaching the artworks.",
      "**Don't** promote demo labels, mock artist data, or inherited starter-page styles into reusable brand conventions.",
      "**Don't** mix the administration shell's Arial/teal tokens into the public gallery or infer production-film quality from demonstration captures."
    ]
  }
}
